2. Obscura — vendored internal browser engine (Apache License 2.0)
=========================================================================

IraLens vendors core components of the Obscura headless browser engine
(https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura, Apache License 2.0, Copyright its
respective authors) under `iralens/_internal/browser_engine/vendor/obscura`
